{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6352","title":"Xiaomi Auto Enters European Market in 2027: Signs MoU with First Batch of Leading German Automotive Dealer Groups","desc":"Signing ceremony held during IFA Berlin's press day underscores Xiaomi Auto's long-term commitment to the European market","view_cnt":"3468","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1788415309","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/884_operatorx_operatorx_opx/03/09/2026/b0d55f2a6aea8f172892a08436acf0ab.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBerlin, GERMANY, September 3, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e — Xiaomi Auto today announced its entry into European markets including Germany in 2027, signing Memoranda of Understanding (MoUs) with the first batch of leading German automotive dealer groups at IFA Berlin 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi Auto to Enter European Markets Including Germany in 2027\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing its rapid growth in China, where Xiaomi has delivered over 700,000 vehicles since launching its first EV in early 2024, Xiaomi Auto aims to build high-quality smart electrified vehicles that bring seamless, intelligent living to users worldwide. Europe, the birthplace of the automobile and one of the world's most mature automotive markets, is a milestone destination in Xiaomi Auto's international journey.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe signing ceremony at IFA Berlin marks the first step in building a high-quality retail and service network for the European market. Xiaomi Auto is committed to partnering with more European dealers to deliver world-class products and premium service experiences to local customers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGermany, home to many of the world's most established and storied automotive dealer groups, is where that foundation begins, with further partnerships across Europe to follow as Xiaomi Auto approaches its planned 2027 launch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/248_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/09/2026/c4e2190eb137d62dd712a428cff83f21.jpg\" alt=\"A group of people is posing on stage, with the background displaying the words \u0026quot;Xiaomi Auto Partnership Signing Ceremony.\u0026quot; The event date is September 3, 2026, and the location is Berlin.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eEight Dealer Groups Representing Germany's Retail Excellence\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe eight dealer groups — Ernst Dello GmbH \u0026amp; Co. KG, Autohaus Dinnebier GmbH, Emil Frey Germany, Fett \u0026amp; Wirtz Automobile GmbH \u0026amp; Co. KG, Hahn Automobile GmbH + Co. KG, LUEG Mobility GmbH, Penske-Jacobs Innovation GmbH, SPT Avior SE \u0026amp; Co. KG — are among the most established and respected automotive dealer groups in Germany and across Europe, with many decades of combined experience and deep expertise in premium brand operations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Standing in Berlin, we are pleased to begin this new chapter with eight of the most respected automotive dealer partners in Germany.\" said Dr. Yu Liguo, Vice President of Xiaomi Auto, Head of Xiaomi Auto International Business Department. \"Xiaomi Auto is committed to long-term investment in Europe. With our European R\u0026amp;D center in Munich and a growing network of sales and service partners, we are dedicated to bringing European customers innovative products and first-class service experiences. Local partnerships are at the heart of this commitment.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eXiaomi at IFA Berlin 2026\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eToday's signing took place during the press day at Xiaomi booth at IFA Berlin 2026, one of the world's leading consumer electronics and technology trade shows. Xiaomi is showcasing its latest innovations and its \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem at the event, including Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo. Visitors can explore the full lineup at Hall 6.2b – Stand 101 when the show opens to the public from September 4–8, 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\"Human × Car × Home\": How Xiaomi Auto Extends the Smart Ecosystem onto the Road\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Auto brings the mobility dimension of Xiaomi's \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem to life, extending Xiaomi's intelligent experiences from personal devices and the home onto the road. Since delivering its first vehicle in March 2024, Xiaomi Auto has grown rapidly, delivering more than 700,000 vehicles in the Chinese Mainland — Xiaomi SU7 Series crossed 500,000 units in only 28.5 months, and Xiaomi YU7 drew over 240,000 lock-in orders within 18 hours of launch. Xiaomi SU7 also ranked No. 1 in the Large BEV segment of the J.D. Power China New Energy Vehicle Initial Quality Study (NEV-IQS) for two consecutive years (2025 and 2026), reflecting strong owner satisfaction with quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis progress is underpinned by deep investment in technology, validated at the Nürburgring Nordschleife — one of the world's most demanding proving grounds. There, the production model of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra with Track Package set the official Nürburgring record in the \"Electric Executive Car\" category at 7:04.957 in April 2025, while Xiaomi YU7 GT with Track Package, set the first officially timed record in the newly created \"Autonomous Driving\" category (under Electric Vehicles) — completing the full 20.8 km circuit entirely without a human driver in 10:29.483, a world first. Xiaomi Auto continues to expand its lineup, most recently entering the Range-Extended Electric Vehicle (REEV) segment in July 2026 with the technology reveal of Xiaomi SkyNomad Series, built on Xiaomi Kunlun HyperRange.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn late August 2026, Xiaomi Auto launched its global website and official international social channels, beginning direct engagement with users worldwide ahead of its planned entry into European markets, including Germany, in 2027.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor more information:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGlobal website: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.xiaomiauto.com/global\"\u003ehttps://www.xiaomiauto.com/global\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSocial media: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/xiaomiauto1\"\u003eFacebook\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/xiaomi.auto\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://x.com/xiaomiauto_\"\u003eX\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@xiaomi.auto\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@xiaomi_auto\"\u003eYouTube\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2026, the MAU reached 766.5 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of June 30, 2026, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,160.8 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 700,000 units by July 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"182","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1788436025"},"common":null}